<title>JAPAN: Japan March oil product imports fall 12.7pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan March oil product imports fall 12.7pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry issued the following data on oil product imports during March. (Barrel equivalents are also shown):</p>
<p>(In 1,000 kl)(1,000 bbl) mth/mth%  yr/yr %</p>
<p> Gasoline	52	  327    -25.7     +57.6</p>
<p> Naphtha    2,522     15,863    +16.5     +11.1</p>
<p> Kerosene     318	 2000    -44.7     -59.0</p>
<p> Gas oil	 94	  591    +32.4     -58.8</p>
<p> Fuel oil A    90	  566    -18.2     -24.4</p>
<p> Fuel oil C   179	1,126    - 4.8     -40.9</p>
<p> TOTAL	3,255     20,474    + 2.4     -12.3</p>
</text>
